.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH new 1  "new " 
.SH NAME
new \- Create a snippet from a template and open it in $EDITOR; validation errors loop back into the editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBnew\fR [\fB\-\-script\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a snippet from a template and open it in $EDITOR; validation errors loop back into the editor
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-script\fR
Start from the script\-mode template (default: steps)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Name for the new snippet
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg new deploy
  fg new deploy \-\-script
